  <h3>Heat and moisture migration modeling in long-term paddy storage using in-situ sensors</h3>
  <p class="meta"><span class="venue">Poster, ICFoST 2025, NIFTEM Thanjavur</span> &nbsp;·&nbsp; Agro-Bio Technology Lab, IIT Kharagpur, with the Food Corporation of India</p>
  <figure class="fig" data-fig>
    {% include "figures/grain.svg" %}
    <script type="application/json" id="grain-data">{{ grain | dump | safe }}</script>
    <figcaption>The fields step through 12 to 18 June in sync with the daily budget. They are interpolated in the browser from approximate per sensor values read off the project's daily maps, so shapes and trends are faithful but individual numbers are approximate. The budgets themselves come from integrating the sensor readings over a tetrahedral mesh of the stack.</figcaption>
